# Debugging Process
Unless absultely sure what the issue/bug is, use this process for debugging issues.
1. Analyze the provided information
2. Ask for more information if you are missing something
3. Add logging to the relavant code
4. Ask the user to run a test and provide you with the logs
5. Analyze the new logs
6. If you have found the couse of the bug, fix it and remove all logging, if not repeat from step 1.


# IMPORTANT
- All files names should use kebab-case
- Always use the components in the @components/ui folder. If a needed component does not exist create the component.